OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Barber
OL,6,     F2/5. Donald Macleod explores a
OL,7,     Fperiod in Barber's life when he
OL,8,     Fcomposed his iconic Piano Sonata.
OL,9,G1700 In Tune
OL,10,     FJulian Joseph performs live ahead
OL,11,     Fof his 60th birthday concert at
OL,12,     FWorld Heart Beat in London on
OL,13,     F17/07. Soprano Heloise Werner
OL,14,     Fdiscusses her Wigmore Hall
OL,15,     Fappearance, also on 17/07.
OL,16,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,17,     FThe second of four Classical
OL,18,     FMixtapes featuring music in this
OL,19,     Fyear's BBC Proms, including music
OL,20,     Fby Canteloube, Janacek, Caroline
OL,21,     FShaw and Bartok.
